<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4639"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Analyzer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Analyzer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 24, 2005 - 4:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here is a map showing the addresses of the 3 victims <BR> <BR>Delores &#34;Dee&#34; Davis <BR>Marine Hedge <BR>Carol Mould <BR> <BR><a href="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v622/JMTTS/Wichita4a.jpg" target=_top>http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v622/JMTTS/Wichi ta4a.jpg</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
